OL,3,GNEWSARed route trial paused after
OL,4,Acouncil U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new coalition in charge of Luton
OL,7,FBorough Council has paused plans for an
OL,8,F18-month trial of red routes in part of
OL,9,Fthe town.
OL,11,FLast month, the previous Labour
OL,12,Fexecutive green-lit the scheme, which
OL,13,Fwould have seen all stopping and
OL,14,Floading banned in Bury Park, despite
OL,15,Fclaims people involved in the plans had
OL,16,Freceived death threats.
OL,18,FHowever, a no-confidence vote saw the
OL,19,Fleadership of the authority change to a
OL,20,Fnew Liberal Democrat-led
OL,21,Fadministration.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
