OL,3,GNEWSARed route trial paused after
OL,4,Acouncil U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeader Amjid Ali said: "Whilst we have
OL,7,Fnot implemented the red route we have
OL,8,Fcontinued to undergo an impact
OL,9,Fassessment. Enforcement has been
OL,10,Fincreased and we are working with
OL,11,Fseveral locations to create more
OL,12,Fparking facilities within the area."
